{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05201","headline":"送苏八给事出牧徐州用芳韵 · 卢僎","name":"送苏八给事出牧徐州用芳韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金鼎属元方，璅闱连季常。\n畏盈聊出守，分命乃维良。\n晓骑辞朝远，春帆向楚常。\n贤哉谦自牧，天下咏余芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢僎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}